ement for the product AbaStart.","moniker":"abaclient","name":"AbaClient","packageUrl":"https://downloads.abacus.ch/en/downloads/abaclient","publisher":"Abacus Research AG","publisherUrl":"https://www.abacus.ch/en/","tags":[]},"zh-CN":{"description":"AbaClient 允许登录您的 Abacus 商业软件或 AbaWeb - 无需任何互联网浏览器，也无需安装 Java。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"AbaClient 结合了由 Abacus 控制的 Java 环境和根据 Abacus 需求定制的浏览器。Java 环境基于开放源码项目 OpenJDK，与 Oracle 没有任何依赖关系。浏览器允许使用 Abacus 生成的证书，且不会出现警告信息。\nAbaClient 可识别并支持新的“abalink”格式，该格式将从 Abacus 2019 版本开始使用。\nAbaClient 还用于替代 AbaStart 产品。","tags":[]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.abacus.ch/en/","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/Abacus/AbaClient/4.0.1124/Abacus.AbaClient.yaml","sha256":"6501edebed20f270eb1d5ffd7fc07a211a656fb44d4758ef0356a350754ffb79"},{"path":"manifests/a/Abacus/AbaClient/4.0.1124/Abacus.AbaClient.installer.yaml","sha256":"1b7ed3bf93bd08bdaf706d26fa2568405209e10aa012f80323229c897ec762b3"},{"path":"manifests/a/Abacus/AbaClient/4.0.1124/Abacus.AbaClient.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"e4d36d852759ecd323ebcc578554417736e096c71c906d4e13f6e2ddd8bf0f6e"},{"path":"manifests/a/Abacus/AbaClient/4.0.1124/Abacus.AbaClient.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"d1d89c5ab40022fffcdec496cfd3f49a426628797366bf1f5aa6800aad99edc6"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"4.0.1124"}